<item>
  <title>Digital Connectivity Rating Platform</title>
  <link>http://www.trai.gov.in/node/18730</link>
  <description>
&lt;span&gt;Digital Connectivity Rating Platform&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;nitinkumar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span&gt;&lt;time datetime="2026-10-01T11:56:02+05:30" title="Thursday, October 1, 2026 - 11:56"&gt;Thu, 10/01/2026 - 11:56&lt;/time&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;

            &lt;div class="text-content clearfix field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a style="color:#00438e !important;text-decoration:underline !important;" href="https://dcrp.trai.gov.in/" target="_blank" aria-label="Digital Connectivity Rating Platform link opens in a new tab"&gt;Digital Connectivity Rating Platform&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The DCR Platform facilitates implementation of the framework prescribed under the Telecom Regulatory Authority of India (Rating of Properties for Digital Connectivity) Regulations, 2024. It brings Property Managers (PMs) registered Digital Connectivity Rating Agency (DCRA) and consumer onto a common digital interface.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Property Managers can register their properties in category of Public, Government, Commercial, Private etc., submit rating applications, upload the prescribed information and documents, select a registered DCRA and track the status of their application through the platform. The platform supports the prescribed assessment workflow for both constructed and under-construction properties.Registered DCRAs can access assigned applications, undertake assessments, record observations and test results, manage supporting documentation and complete the rating process in accordance with the prescribed framework. The platform enables the digital workflow relating to assessment, report generation, certification and publication of ratings. Consumers and other stakeholders will be able to search rated properties, view published ratings, verify the corresponding certificates and compare the properties of interest.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-image-upload field--type-image field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;image&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;div class="field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="lazy" src="http://www.trai.gov.in/sites/default/files/2026-10/DCRP_01102026.jpg" width="500" height="500" alt="Digital Connectivity Rating Platform"&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-weight-order field--type-integer field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Weight_order&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;1&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
